<p style="text-align: left;">A sketch of the trees across the street from our house. This is based on a painting of the same scene that I did from life earlier in the year before the grass had greened up in the spring. &nbsp;This time around I tried to paint what I thought would work rather than what direct observation suggested.&nbsp;</p>